      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-295616",
      ":question/problem": "A science teacher recorded the number of books each of her students read over the summer. The incomplete data set is shown below.\n\n| Books Read | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $1$ |\n| $2$ | $2$ |\n| $3$ | $x$ |\n| $4$ | $8$ |\n| $5$ | $6$ |\n| $6$ | $9$ |\n\nIf the only mode of the data set is $3$, which of the following values could be the value of $x$?\n\n1. $9$\n2. $10$\n3. $8$"
