      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-295617",
      ":question/problem": "A librarian recorded the number of books that each of the students borrowed during the first week of school. The incomplete data set is shown below.\n\n| Books Borrowed | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $7$ |\n| $2$ | $5$ |\n| $3$ | $x$ |\n| $4$ | $8$ |\n| $5$ | $6$ |\n| $6$ | $3$ |\n\nIf $3$ is **NOT** the mode of the data set, which of the following values could be the value of $x$?\n\n1. $7$\n2. $8$\n3. $9$"
